Subject: [PATCH 33/58] Guide: Join Xbox Live from the gamer card
 (XamShowLiveSignupUI)

The gamer card's Join Xbox Live (9010CB28) closes gamerprofile and calls
XamShowLiveSignupUI (9010C898). xam 818EDD78 sends message 0x2100E:
createprofile.xex in mode 1, whose first scene is AddXboxLive.xur
(90105388). It goes straight to the Xbox Live steps (90103880 -> 90103278)
for the signed-in profile. Cancel, No or B there end createprofile, since
it is the first scene. Titles calling XamShowLiveSignupUI get the same.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
